# Auth & secrets
auths/*
!auths/.gitkeep
data/*
!data/.gitkeep
*.key
.apikey
.apikey*
*.pem
*.env
.env
.env.*

# Binaries (anchored to repo root only — bare "login"/"credit" would also ignore cmd/login/, cmd/credit/)
/login
/credit
/wb2api
signin_bin

# Config with secrets (use config.example.json)
config.json

# Build artifacts
*.tmp
*.bak
*.log
logs/
__pycache__/

# Backups (contains auth tokens)
backups/

# IDE
.idea/
.vscode/
LOOP.md
PLAN.md
SPEC.md
docs/

# 设计/计划文档（交付包必需的说明文档需显式放行）
*.md
!README.md
!README-upstream.md
!AGENT.md
# 例外（2026-10-03，第十三轮审计 F1）：internal/ 下的 .md 可能是 **go:embed 的构建输入**
# （如 internal/prompt/defaultprompt.md）—— 被忽略的后果不是"少个文档"，而是
# `git archive HEAD` 出来的干净副本 **go build 直接失败**。门禁：
#   bash workbuddy2api/scripts/check-tracked-build-inputs.sh
!internal/**/*.md
